    "billing places a buyer (TypeScript, traffic/hrw.ts); network-service holds the",
    "reference (Go, internal/lease/hrw, vendored from quotaengine, ADR-0093). A",
    "later mover in Go must pick what billing picked, and nothing can be imported",
    "across that boundary, so these cases plus a test on each side replace the",
    "import that does not exist (the delta.json pattern). The TypeScript half is",
    "billing-service/src/app/traffic/hrw.spec.ts; the Go half is",
    "network-service/internal/lease/hrw/contract_test.go.",
